      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "夜に化け物が現れて店を襲っていくんだ！\nなんでもそいつは市街地の奥に消えていくらしい。\n報酬ならはずむ！　あんた、退治してくれないか？\n俺は夜は家に籠もるから、また昼に会いに来てくれ！",
        "official_en": "A monster is appearing at night and attacking shops!\nThey say it disappears into the city streets. Will you\ndefeat it? You'll be rewarded! I'm holed up at home\nat night, so come see me during the day.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
